<main class="min-h-screen bg-stone-50 text-stone-800">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-12 p-8">
    <header class="space-y-3">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-rose-400">Batch Chef</p>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Ваша кухня, ваши рецепты</h1>
      <p class="max-w-2xl text-stone-600">
        Создавайте рецепты, пересчитывайте ингредиенты под форму и готовьте по шагам.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section aria-labelledby="recipe-builder-heading" class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
      <div class="mb-6">
        <h2 id="recipe-builder-heading" class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-stone-900">
          Конструктор рецепта
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-stone-500">
          Заполните основные данные, чтобы сохранить новый рецепт.
        </p>
      </div>

      <form class="space-y-6">
        <div>
          <label for="recipe_title" class="mb-2 block font-medium text-stone-800">
            Название рецепта
          </label>
          <input id="recipe_title" name="recipe_title" type="text"
              placeholder="Например: Лимонный тарт"
              class="w-full cursor-text rounded-xl border border-stone-300 bg-stone-50 px-4 py-3 text-stone-900 shadow-sm outline-none transition-all placeholder:text-stone-400 focus:border-rose-300 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-200">
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-500">Например: Лимонный тарт</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label for="pan_diameter" class="mb-2 block font-medium text-stone-800">
            Диаметр формы, см
          </label>
          <input id="pan_diameter" name="diameter" type="number" min="1" step="1"
              placeholder="18"
              class="w-32 cursor-text rounded-xl border border-stone-300 bg-stone-50 px-4 py-3 text-stone-900 shadow-sm outline-none transition-all placeholder:text-stone-400 focus:border-rose-300 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-200">
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-500">Для пересчета граммовок</p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50 p-4">
          <div class="mb-4">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900">Ингредиенты</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-stone-500">Добавьте все продукты и их количество.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_7rem_7rem_auto]">
            <label class="sr-only" for="ingredient_name">Название ингредиента</label>
            <input id="ingredient_name" type="text" value="Сахар"
                class="cursor-text rounded-lg border border-stone-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 outline-none transition-all focus:border-rose-300 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-200">
            <label class="sr-only" for="ingredient_amount">Количество</label>
            <input id="ingredient_amount" type="number" value="200"
                class="cursor-text rounded-lg border border-stone-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 outline-none transition-all focus:border-rose-300 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-200">
            <label class="sr-only" for="ingredient_unit">Единица измерения</label>
            <select id="ingredient_unit"
                class="cursor-pointer rounded-lg border border-stone-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 outline-none transition-all focus:border-rose-300 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-200">
              <option>г</option>
              <option>мл</option>
              <option>шт.</option>
            </select>
            <button type="button" aria-label="Удалить сахар"
                class="cursor-pointer rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-stone-400 transition-all hover:bg-rose-50 hover:text-rose-500">
              Удалить
            </button>
          </div>

          <button type="button"
              class="mt-4 cursor-pointer rounded-xl border border-stone-300 bg-white px-4 py-2.5 font-medium text-stone-700 shadow-sm transition-all hover:border-rose-300 hover:bg-rose-50 hover:shadow-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-200">
            + Добавить ингредиент
          </button>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-500">Нажмите, чтобы добавить ещё одну строку ингредиента.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-4 border-t border-stone-200 pt-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-500">Рецепт появится в вашем каталоге после сохранения.</p>
          <button type="submit"
              class="w-full cursor-pointer rounded-xl bg-rose-300 px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-stone-900 shadow-sm transition-all hover:bg-rose-400 hover:shadow-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-200 sm:w-auto">
            Сохранить рецепт
          </button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="catalog-heading" class="space-y-4">
      <div>
        <h2 id="catalog-heading" class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Каталог</h2>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-stone-500">Откройте сохраненный рецепт, чтобы посмотреть подробности.</p>
      </div>

      <article class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white shadow-sm transition-all hover:shadow-md sm:flex">
        <div class="flex min-h-56 items-center justify-center bg-rose-100 px-8 text-center text-rose-500 sm:w-2/5">
          <div>
            <span class="text-5xl" aria-hidden="true">🍓</span>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium">Фото рецепта</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col justify-between gap-5 p-6">
          <div>
            <div class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="rounded-full bg-rose-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-rose-700">#десерт</span>
              <span class="rounded-full bg-green-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-green-700">#выпечка</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Клубничный торт</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-stone-500">
              <span aria-hidden="true">⏱️</span>
              Время приготовления: 45 минут
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <button type="button"
                class="cursor-pointer rounded-xl bg-rose-300 px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-stone-900 shadow-sm transition-all hover:bg-rose-400 hover:shadow-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-200">
              Открыть рецепт
            </button>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-500">Посмотреть ингредиенты и шаги приготовления.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="cooking-mode-heading" class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
      <div class="mb-6">
        <h2 id="cooking-mode-heading" class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Режим готовки</h2>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-stone-500">Отмечайте выполненные шаги и готовьте в своем темпе.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <label class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50 p-4 transition-all hover:border-rose-200 hover:shadow-sm">
          <input type="checkbox" checked
              class="h-6 w-6 cursor-pointer rounded border-stone-300 accent-rose-300 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-200">
          <span class="text-lg text-stone-500 line-through">Подготовить клубнику</span>
        </label>
        <label class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50 p-4 transition-all hover:border-rose-200 hover:shadow-sm">
          <input type="checkbox"
              class="h-6 w-6 cursor-pointer rounded border-stone-300 accent-rose-300 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-200">
          <span class="text-lg text-stone-800">Взбить сливки с сахаром</span>
        </label>
        <label class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50 p-4 transition-all hover:border-rose-200 hover:shadow-sm">
          <input type="checkbox"
              class="h-6 w-6 cursor-pointer rounded border-stone-300 accent-rose-300 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rose-200">
          <span class="text-lg text-stone-800">Собрать торт и охладить</span>
        </label>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 border-t border-stone-200 pt-6">
        <button type="button"
            class="cursor-pointer rounded-xl bg-stone-200 px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-stone-800 shadow-sm transition-all hover:bg-stone-300 hover:shadow-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-stone-300">
          <span aria-hidden="true">⏱️</span>
          Запустить таймер
        </button>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-500">Таймер поможет не пропустить время охлаждения или выпечки.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>
